  "question": {
    "text": "The maximum volume (in cu. units) of the cylinder which can be inscribed in a sphere of radius 12 units is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "n9JC4",
      "text": "$384 \\sqrt{3} \\pi$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "TJYRw",
      "text": "$768 \\sqrt{3} \\pi$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "cwzJ7",
      "text": "$\\frac{768 \\pi}{\\sqrt{3}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HrxKR",
      "text": "$\\frac{1152 \\pi}{\\sqrt{3}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$12^2=r^2+\\left(\\frac{h}{2}\\right)^2 \\Rightarrow V=\\pi r^2 h$\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad V=\\pi\\left(144-\\frac{h^2}{4}\\right) h$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/iz6kZkvCfLIqhDLfZ-07Sf825wujqkWx95TpgxB0YRk.original.fullsize.png\"/>\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad V=144 \\pi h-\\frac{\\pi}{4} h^3 \\Rightarrow \\frac{d V}{d h}=144 \\pi-\\frac{3 \\pi}{4} h^2$\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{d V}{d h}=0 \\Rightarrow 144 \\pi=\\frac{3 \\pi}{4} h^2$\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad h^2=48 \\times 4 \\Rightarrow h=8 \\sqrt{3}$\n$\\therefore \\quad 12^2=r^2+48 \\Rightarrow r^2=96$\nVolume $=\\pi r^2 h=\\pi \\times 96 \\times 8 \\sqrt{3}=768 \\sqrt{3} \\pi \\mathrm{~cm}^3$.",
    "image": null
  },
